flowchart LR
    U[User]
    UI[Login Page]
    API[(Login Backend API)]
    DB[(Database)]
    AUTH[(NextAuth Credentials)]
    SESSION[(JWT Session)]

    U -->|Submit email + password| UI
    UI -->|POST credentials| API

    API -->|Validate input| V{Input valid?}
    V -->|No| E400[Return 400 validation error]

    V -->|Yes| AUTH
    AUTH -->|Find user by email| DB
    DB --> AUTH

    AUTH --> C{User exists<br/>and password matches?}
    C -->|No| E401[Return 401 invalid credentials]
    C -->|Yes| SESSION

    SESSION --> S200[Return success + active session]
    S200 --> UI
    UI --> D[Redirect to dashboard]

    API -->|DB unavailable| E503[Return 503 service unavailable]

    classDef ok fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    classDef bad fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    classDef process fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#fff
    classDef decision fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#d97706,color:#fff

    class S200,D,SESSION ok
    class E400,E401,E503 bad
    class UI,API,DB,AUTH process
    class V,C decision
